      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "TITLE",
      "narration_text": "Namaste — this is Liam, in for Ameya. Your vectors have a price tag, and dimension is a cost decision. Ninety seconds.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B01",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B01.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 8.81,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B01.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B01",
        "at": "2026-09-07T22:27:49"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "The one formula: chunks times dimensions times bytes. A million vectors at seven-sixty-eight dimensions is about three gigabytes of RAM.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B02",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B02.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 8.94,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B02.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B02",
        "at": "2026-09-07T22:27:49"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "Halve the dimensions and you halve the storage — and roughly halve the search time too. Bigger isn't automatically better.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B03",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B03.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 8.09,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B03.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B03",
        "at": "2026-09-07T22:27:49"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "LIST",
      "narration_text": "Shrink the numbers themselves. Int eight is four times smaller for little loss. Binary is thirty-two times smaller, but only with a rescoring pass.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B04",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B04.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 8.79,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B04.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B04",
        "at": "2026-09-07T22:27:49"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "So search with the tiny compressed vectors, then rescore the shortlist with the full ones. Compression's speed, almost full accuracy.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B05",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B05.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 7.74,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B05.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B05",
        "at": "2026-09-07T22:27:49"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "In the project, a three-eighty-four dimension model scored eighty-eight percent to a bigger model's seventy-six — half the storage, three times faster. Better and cheaper.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B06",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
